   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( h(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{4}} \\) and \\( k(x) = x - 3 \\). Let R be the region bounded by the graphs of h and k and the x-axis. By integrating with respect to y, find the exact area of R.",
